nd murray break  out of prison you can see a drawing of a  penis hung up on the wall of the russian  guard's shack i'm sorry but throwing  random dick art in the background of a  serious scene might be my favorite  easter egg all season as they escape  highlights fire by the red army choir  plays at max's the hellfire club plans a  trip to the weapons store called warzone  featuring a knockoff rambo as their  mascot max loans eddie the michael myers  mask from her halloween costume in  season two so that he can covertly steal  his neighbor's winnebago this rv has a  lot of interesting stickers like  yosemite sam from looney tunes an  anti-welfare sticker reading can't fetum  breed them and another that says america  love it or leave it then there's  stickers from various destinations like  the grand old opry in nashville  tennessee and six flags inside there are  two stickers one that reads president  reagan bringing america back and the  second that reads keep your city clean  eat a pigeon as steve drives off up  around the bend by creedence clearwater  revival plays in the back seat max tells  lucas her plan to hide in the light when  vecna comes for her without even knowing  about elle's conversation with brenner  about one hiding in darkness she  instinctively knows that she'll have  more power in her happy memories when  lucas asks if he's there in any of her  best memories she says that's  presumptuous of you which is the same  thing she says to him and destin when  they first meet in season two that's  presumptuous of you  us  that's a good thing right as steve and  nancy also talk about steve's dream to  explore the country with his six little  nuggets in tow fire and reign by james  taylor plays at the war zone rock and  roll hoochie coo by rick derringer plays  the bulletin board at the front of the  store is plastered with wanted posters  for the hellfire club even more  horrifying however is when robin sees  her crush vicky making out with some  dude in 